Complete the in-place reverse:

```dart
void reverse(List<int> a) {
  var left = 0, right = a.length - 1;
  while (left %order% right) {
    final tmp = a[left];
    a[left] = a[%order%];
    a[right] = %order%;
    left++;
    right--;
  }
}
```

